    #  IS A MEASURED CLAIM, NOT A GUESS. ***  `VRIP_INTR_SIU + 1` is vrip.10,
    #  which dev_vr41xx_init HAS registered, so it connects in silence: that
    #  mutant scored 26/26 against every behavioural row in this file before
